%h1 New User Registration
%p
  Hello #{@admin.first_name},
%p
  A new user has registered on the platform:
%table
  %tr
    %td Name:
    %td= "#{@user.first_name} #{@user.last_name}"
  %tr
    %td Email:
    %td= @user.email
  %tr
    %td Job Title:
    %td= @user.job_title
  %tr
    %td Phone:
    %td= @user.phone_number
%p
  Please review this user's information and take any necessary actions.